 "text": "9/29/26, 10:15 AM\n\nFunctions only with Change                            Calling the function\n\nDeactivate installment plan                           Installment Plan >\u00bb Deactivate\nInstallment Plan\n\nAdd installment                                           Edit \u00bb Add Installment\n\nDelete installment                                        Select the appropriate installment(s) and\nchoose |+Edit Delete Installment\n\nDisplay source receivables in the                      Goto \u00bb Display Source Receivables for\ninstallment plan history                             Installment Plan\n\nProcedure / Notes\n\nIf the installment plan has not yet been paid\nor has been partially paid, an automatic\n\nreversal of the interest and the charge\ndocument for this installment plan is\n\npossible.\n\nIf you add or delete installments, you must\nthen ensure that the total of the installment\n\nplan corresponds to the amount of the\nsource receivable.\n\nIf you add or delete installments, you must\nthen ensure that the total of the installment\nplan corresponds to the amount of the\nsource receivable.\n\nThis brings you to the installment plan\nhistory. It will tell you which receivables are\nincluded in the installment plan. This\n\nfunction is also possible after the\nreactivation of the installment plan.\n",
